{%- comment -%}
  Affiliate Brand Hub
  Public page for Kyn Skyn affiliates. Single long-form section
  with a download pack and print-friendly layout so anyone can
  save-as-PDF and hand it around as a brand kit. No auth gating —
  if you don't have a portal account, the bottom CTA points you at
  AffiliateBase to apply.
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
.afh {
  --burgundy: #641220;
  --burnt-red: #C54427;
  --deep-green: #055528;
  --teal: #055A5B;
  --navy: #1F3F6F;
  --pink: #FDB1BD;
  --lime: #C5DE55;
  --cyan: #C5FEFF;
  --light-gray: #DAE3E7;
  --periwinkle: #B6CBEB;
  --text-dark: #2D1015;
  --text-body: #3D2025;
  --gold-soft: #f4e6c4;

  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--text-body);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  position: relative;
  padding: 96px 24px 80px;
}

.afh__wrap {
  max-width: 880px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

/* ── Section spacing ── */
.afh__block {
  margin-top: 56px;
  padding-top: 24px;
}

.afh__block:first-of-type {
  margin-top: 0;
  padding-top: 0;
}

.afh__eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--burnt-red);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.afh h1 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.4rem);
  line-height: 1.06;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.afh h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
  line-height: 1.18;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}

.afh h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  line-height: 1.3;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  margin: 24px 0 10px;
}

.afh p { margin: 0 0 14px; }

.afh p.lede {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--text-dark);
}

.afh a { color: var(--burnt-red); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 0.18em; }
.afh a:hover { color: var(--burgundy); }

/* ── Hero ── */
.afh__hero {
  background: var(--gold-soft);
  border-radius: 28px;
  padding: 48px 32px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.afh__hero h1 { margin-bottom: 8px; }

.afh__hero-sub {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-weight: 300;
  font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem);
  color: var(--text-dark);
  margin: 0 0 24px;
  max-width: 38ch;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.afh__hero-cta {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--burgundy);
  color: var(--cream);
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: 14px 28px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  transition: background 0.2s;
}

.afh__hero-cta:hover { background: var(--button); color: var(--cream); }

.afh__hero-mark {
  position: absolute;
  right: -20px;
  bottom: -20px;
  width: 200px;
  opacity: 0.18;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* ── Two-up media + body ── */
.afh__split {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 32px;
  align-items: center;
}

.afh__split img,
.afh__split svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: 16px;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .afh__split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ── Audience list ── */
.afh__audience {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 12px 0 0;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 14px;
}

.afh__audience li {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid rgba(100, 18, 32, 0.18);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 16px 18px;
  font-size: 0.97rem;
  line-height: 1.45;
}

.afh__audience li strong {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .afh__audience { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ── Do / Don't ── */
.afh__dodont {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
  margin: 16px 0;
}

.afh__dodont > div {
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 22px;
}

.afh__do  { background: rgba(5, 85, 40, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(5, 85, 40, 0.18); }
.afh__dont { background: rgba(197, 68, 39, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(197, 68, 39, 0.18); }

.afh__dodont h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}

.afh__do  h4 { color: var(--deep-green); }
.afh__dont h4 { color: var(--burnt-red); }

.afh__dodont ul { padding: 0; margin: 0; list-style: none; }
.afh__dodont li { padding: 6px 0; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
.afh__dodont li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .afh__dodont { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ── Sample captions (copy boxes) ── */
.afh__captions {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 16px;
}

.afh__caption {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid rgba(100, 18, 32, 0.18);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  font-size: 0.97rem;
  line-height: 1.5;
  position: relative;
}

.afh__caption-tag {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: var(--gold-soft);
  color: var(--burgundy);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .afh__captions { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ── Download category heading ── */
.afh__dl-cat {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--burnt-red);
  margin: 28px 0 12px;
}

.afh__dl-cat:first-of-type { margin-top: 8px; }

/* ── Logo + font card (generic two-up: preview + meta + format buttons) ── */
.afh__asset {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid rgba(100, 18, 32, 0.18);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 14px 18px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.afh__asset-preview {
  width: 110px;
  height: 64px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* Preview backgrounds per color, so the variant is legible */
.afh__asset-preview--orange { background: #FFF1E6; }
.afh__asset-preview--black  { background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
.afh__asset-preview--white  { background: var(--burgundy); }
.afh__asset-preview--yellow { background: var(--burgundy); }

.afh__asset-preview img {
  max-width: 80%;
  max-height: 80%;
  object-fit: contain;
}

.afh__asset-meta { min-width: 0; }
.afh__asset-name {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 2px;
}
.afh__asset-desc {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--text-body);
  opacity: 0.72;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.afh__asset-formats { display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; }

.afh__btn {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--burgundy);
  color: var(--cream);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background 0.15s;
}

.afh__btn:hover { background: var(--button); color: var(--cream); }

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .afh__asset {
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    gap: 12px 14px;
  }
  .afh__asset-formats { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .afh__asset-preview { width: 80px; height: 56px; }
}

/* ── Logo group: one card per lockup type with per-color download rows ── */
.afh__logoblock {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid rgba(100, 18, 32, 0.18);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.afh__logoblock-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  padding-bottom: 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(100, 18, 32, 0.1);
}

.afh__logoblock-preview {
  flex: 0 0 96px;
  height: 64px;
  background: #FFF1E6;
  border-radius: 8px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding: 8px;
}

.afh__logoblock-preview img { max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }

.afh__logoblock-meta { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.afh__logoblock-name {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 2px;
}
.afh__logoblock-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-body); opacity: 0.72; line-height: 1.4; }

.afh__logoblock-rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }

.afh__logoblock-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 14px 1fr auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
}

.afh__logoblock-row + .afh__logoblock-row { padding-top: 6px; border-top: 1px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }

.afh__swatch {
  width: 12px;
  height: 12px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  display: inline-block;
}

.afh__swatch--orange { background: #C54427; }
.afh__swatch--black { background: #000; }
.afh__swatch--white { background: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
.afh__swatch--yellow { background: #F8B044; }

.afh__logoblock-color { color: var(--text-body); }

.afh__logoblock-formats { display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; }

/* ── Font licensing note ── */
.afh__font-note {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  opacity: 0.75;
  margin: 6px 0 14px;
  padding-left: 12px;
  border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
  line-height: 1.45;
}

/* ── Steps ── */
.afh__steps {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
  margin-top: 16px;
  counter-reset: afhstep;
}

.afh__step {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid rgba(100, 18, 32, 0.18);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 22px;
  position: relative;
}

.afh__step::before {
  counter-increment: afhstep;
  content: counter(afhstep);
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: 2.2rem;
  color: var(--burnt-red);
  line-height: 1;
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.afh__step h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 1.15rem; }
.afh__step p { font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0; }

@media (max-width: 640px) { .afh__steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

/* ── Final CTA ── */
.afh__final {
  background: var(--burgundy);
  color: var(--cream);
  border-radius: 24px;
  padding: 40px 32px;
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 64px;
}

.afh__final h2 { color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 10px; }
.afh__final p { color: rgba(255,244,206,0.85); margin-bottom: 22px; }

.afh__final a {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--gold);
  color: var(--burgundy);
  padding: 14px 30px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

.afh__final a:hover { background: var(--cream); }

/* ── Print stylesheet: save-as-PDF gets a clean handout ── */
@media print {
  @page { size: A4; margin: 18mm 14mm; }

  body, .afh { background: #ffffff !important; color: #000 !important; font-size: 11pt; }

  /* Hide site chrome */
  .site-header, .header-nav, .mobile-tab-bar, footer.site-footer, .afh__final a:not([href]) { display: none !important; }

  .afh { padding: 0 !important; }
  .afh__wrap { max-width: 100% !important; }

  .afh__hero, .afh__step, .afh__caption, .afh__asset, .afh__logoblock, .afh__audience li, .afh__do, .afh__dont {
    background: #fff !important;
    border: 1px solid #000 !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
  }

  .afh__hero-mark { display: none !important; }
  .afh__hero-cta, .afh__btn { color: #000 !important; background: #fff !important; border: 1px solid #000 !important; }

  .afh h1, .afh h2, .afh h3, .afh__dl-cat { color: #000 !important; }
  .afh__eyebrow, .afh__caption-tag { color: #000 !important; background: transparent !important; border: 1px solid #000 !important; }
  .afh a { color: #000 !important; text-decoration: underline; }

  .afh__asset a[download]::after,
  .afh__logoblock-row a[download]::after {
    content: " " attr(href);
    font-size: 7pt;
    color: #444 !important;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  /* Hide colored preview backgrounds in print */
  .afh__asset-preview, .afh__logoblock-preview { background: #fff !important; border: 1px solid #000 !important; }
  .afh__swatch { border: 1px solid #000 !important; }

  /* Page breaks */
  .afh__block { break-inside: avoid; }
  h2 { break-after: avoid; }

  .afh__final {
    background: #fff !important;
    color: #000 !important;
    border: 2px solid #000 !important;
  }
  .afh__final p, .afh__final h2 { color: #000 !important; }
  .afh__final a { background: #fff !important; color: #000 !important; border: 1px solid #000; }
}
</style>

<section class="afh">
  <div class="afh__wrap">

    {%- comment -%} ── 1. HERO ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <header class="afh__hero">
      <p class="afh__eyebrow">Kyn Skyn affiliate hub</p>
      <h1>Promote Kyn Skyn.</h1>
      <p class="afh__hero-sub">Recurring commission on every sale. Up to 12 months per customer, with a 60-day attribution window. Your specific rate lives in your portal.</p>
      <a class="afh__hero-cta" href="https://affiliate-kynskyn.affiliatebase.io">Sign in to your portal</a>
      <img class="afh__hero-mark" src="{{ 'logomark.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="">
    </header>

    {%- comment -%} ── 2. WHAT WE DO ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="afh__block">
      <p class="afh__eyebrow">What we do</p>
      <h2>Online dermatology for stubborn skin conditions.</h2>
      <div class="afh__split">
        <div>
          <p class="lede">Kyn Skyn treats skin problems that regular acne products can't fix.</p>
          <p>The root cause for most of our patients is a yeast called <em>Malassezia</em>. It lives on everyone's skin. For some people, it grows out of control and causes fungal acne, dandruff, or patchy skin tone changes.</p>
          <p>Our patients take photos, fill out a short intake, and get reviewed by a board-certified dermatologist. The doctor sends a prescription to the patient's pharmacy. Most people see real changes in 6 to 12 weeks.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="{{ 'seb-derm-02-why-it-happens.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Diagram explaining how Malassezia yeast causes fungal acne and seb derm">
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ── 3. WHO BUYS ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="afh__block">
      <p class="afh__eyebrow">Who Kyn is for</p>
      <h2>Three groups of people will respond to your link.</h2>
      <ul class="afh__audience">
        <li>
          <strong>Fungal acne</strong>
          Adults with small same-sized bumps on the forehead, chest, or back that don't go away with regular acne products. They've usually tried everything.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Seb derm and dandruff</strong>
          People with flaky, itchy patches on the scalp, eyebrows, or sides of the nose. It keeps coming back no matter what shampoo they buy.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Tinea versicolor</strong>
          People who get patches of lighter or darker skin, often on the back or chest, that show up more after sun exposure.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>People who want a real doctor</strong>
          Not an app. Not a chatbot. A board-certified dermatologist. Async means they don't need to take time off work for an appointment.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ── 4. HOW YOU EARN ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="afh__block">
      <p class="afh__eyebrow">How you earn</p>
      <h2>Recurring commission on every sale.</h2>
      <p>Your exact rate is set in your portal. Different affiliate tiers earn different rates, so check there for the specific math on each product.</p>
      <p>The mechanics are the same for every tier:</p>
      <ul class="afh__audience" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;">
        <li>
          <strong>60-day attribution window</strong>
          Every customer who clicks your link and buys within 60 days is yours.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Up to 12 months per customer</strong>
          You earn on the first sale and every renewal, until that customer hits 12 months.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Payouts run through AffiliateBase</strong>
          Schedule and minimum payout threshold show in your portal.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ── 5. BRAND TONE ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="afh__block">
      <p class="afh__eyebrow">How to talk about Kyn</p>
      <h2>Talk like a doctor explaining things to a friend.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Plain words. Real science. No hype. We treat readers as smart adults who can handle the truth about their skin.</p>

      <div class="afh__dodont">
        <div class="afh__do">
          <h4>Do</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Name the condition. "Fungal acne" or "Malassezia folliculitis", not "weird bumps".</li>
            <li>Say what's true. "Most people with fungal acne spent years thinking it was acne."</li>
            <li>Be specific. "Ketoconazole shampoo works for dandruff that won't quit." Not "the right products".</li>
            <li>Trust the reader. State the fact and stop.</li>
            <li>Use real prices and real timelines. "Most people see change in 6 to 12 weeks."</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="afh__dont">
          <h4>Don't</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Use hype words like "miracle", "breakthrough", or "transform".</li>
            <li>Promise a cure. Say "treatment plan" or "what works".</li>
            <li>Use em-dashes. Use commas, periods, or colons instead.</li>
            <li>Add fluff like "no spam, we promise". Say the fact, end the sentence.</li>
            <li>Talk down to readers ("babe", "bestie") or oversell ("glow up", "flawless").</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3>Sample posts you can copy</h3>
      <div class="afh__captions">
        <article class="afh__caption">
          <span class="afh__caption-tag">Myth-busting</span>
          Most acne creams make fungal acne worse. The bumps look the same. The cause is different. Fungal acne is a yeast called Malassezia. The fix is an antifungal, not a retinoid. A Kyn dermatologist can tell you which one you have. $59.
        </article>
        <article class="afh__caption">
          <span class="afh__caption-tag">Education</span>
          Tea tree oil kills fungus in a lab. On your skin, at a useful dose, it mostly causes irritation. Standard antifungals have actual studies behind them. That's the difference between TikTok and a dermatologist.
        </article>
        <article class="afh__caption">
          <span class="afh__caption-tag">Outcome</span>
          Years of acne products that didn't work? It might be fungal acne. A board-certified dermatologist reviews your photos online and sends a prescription to your pharmacy. No more guessing.
        </article>
        <article class="afh__caption">
          <span class="afh__caption-tag">Audience</span>
          If your scalp itches and flakes, or your forehead has small bumps that ignore retinol, it's worth asking a dermatologist about Malassezia. That's the yeast Kyn treats.
        </article>
        <article class="afh__caption">
          <span class="afh__caption-tag">Trust</span>
          Every Kyn consultation is reviewed by a board-certified dermatologist. Not an app. Not a chatbot. A real doctor, $59, sent to your pharmacy.
        </article>
        <article class="afh__caption">
          <span class="afh__caption-tag">Plan</span>
          Kyn isn't a one-bottle fix. It's Kyn Care: ongoing dermatologic care for chronic skin conditions, with prescription access when appropriate, follow-ups, and doctor-guided maintenance. $29.99 a month after the first visit. Same dermatologist.
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} ── 6. DOWNLOAD PACK ── {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="afh__block">
      <p class="afh__eyebrow">Download pack</p>
      <h2>Brand assets you can use, right now.</h2>
      <p>Everything organised by type. Pick the file you need. Don't change the logo art. Always credit Kyn Skyn.</p>

      {%- comment -%} ── LOGOS ── {%- endcomment -%}
      <p class="afh__dl-cat">Logos</p>

      <article class="afh__logoblock">
        <header class="afh__logoblock-head">
          <div class="afh__logoblock-preview">
            <img src="{{ 'kyn-skyn-logomark-orange.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Kyn Skyn logomark">
          </div>
          <div class="afh__logoblock-meta">
            <span class="afh__logoblock-name">Logomark</span>
            <span class="afh__logoblock-desc">The icon alone. Use for app icons, social profile pictures, favicons.</span>
          </div>
